      "rationale": "The core contribution — using GTED as a formally-grounded faithfulness anchor to measure gaming resistance via rank correlation — is a genuinely novel application to autoformalization. The theoretical contamination model and cross-method comparison (GRS vs exploitation-rate vs GRIFT) add methodological depth. However, GRS remains a standard statistic (Spearman ρ) recontextualized, and AGRC is an acknowledged signal-swap variant of DRW. After 5 rounds of iteration, the proposal has become a mosaic of incremental improvements rather than one sharp, exciting insight."
