      "rationale": "All required models (Qwen2.5-Coder-7B, Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B, CriticLeanGPT-Qwen3-14B-RL) and datasets are confirmed available. GPU cost at ~$2.50/hr H100 is on the higher end (spot prices are $1.03–$1.65 in May 2026), making the budget conservative. However, the 10-configuration ablation + GRIFT gradient comparison + metric ablation + cross-method comparison + DRW head-to-head + CriticLeanGPT retraining is an enormous scope for 15–17 weeks. Risk of scope creep is high, especially with unverified LeanInteract v0.11.3 (latest confirmed features are from v0.9.0)."
